 {
  "name": "minerscave-2",
  "music": "Elevator Music.mp3",
  "music_vol": 0.2,
  "highlight": [
   "survival",
   "Minerscave",
   "trees",
   "friends",
   "saves",
   "crystal",
   "free",
   "CREATOR"
  ],
  "cta_sentence": 6,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "Roblox finally has its own block survival game.",
    "clips": [
     {
      "id": "bd12e005987f",
      "at": 1.0
     },
     {
      "id": "45a92ea7060f",
      "at": 3.0,
      "flash": true
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "text": "It's called Minerscave.",
    "clips": [
     {
      "id": "9e6d69010bf3",
      "at": 1.0,
      "bw": true
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "text": "Chop trees, craft your tools,",
    "clips": [
     {
      "id": "d62cbed41ef6",
      "at": 10.0,
      "lift": 1.4
     },
     {
      "id": "23b83f65dcd0",
      "at": 0.5
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "text": "and build your base with your friends.",
    "clips": [
     {
      "id": "a80ac864d888",
      "at": 3.0
     },
     {
      "id": "a0e4f0633382",
      "at": 9.0
     },
     {
      "id": "3e0d345dd4f9",
      "at": 1.0
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "text": "In My World, every build and chest saves, so you can turn it into a series.",
    "clips": [
     {
      "id": "b095e707d9b4",
      "at": 1.0,
      "lift": 1.3
     },
     {
      "id": "9e6d69010bf3",
      "at": 3.0
     },
     {
      "id": "45a92ea7060f",
      "at": 0.5
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "text": "Then dig down into glowing crystal caves full of ore.",
    "clips": [
     {
      "id": "7023efcfece8",
      "at": 1.0,
      "lift": 1.1
     },
     {
      "id": "2c75f88f951d",
      "at": 2.0,
      "lift": 1.2
     },
     {
      "id": "58c1e6108435",
      "at": 4.0,
      "lift": 1.2
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "text": "Minerscave is free on Roblox right now.",
    "clips": [
     {
      "id": "207442290c98",
      "at": 0.5
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "text": "Use code CREATOR for a free starter kit. Go play it.",
    "clips": [
     {
      "id": "d8395c1110e0",
      "at": 8.0
     }
    ]
   }
  ],
